    "cons": [
      "Listed at 53.5 lb, heavy to carry",
      "Independent testing measured about 30 miles, not 43",
      "Regional versions have different speed limits"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "For most commuters, the Segway Max G2 is the safest long-range bet: a large battery, a 22 mph rating, IPX5 water resistance and listed UL 2272 certification, as long as you rarely have to carry it."
  },
