    "description": "The Hiboy S2 Max is the value pick for commuters who want a strong motor and a long rated range without paying premium-brand prices. Hiboy lists a 500 W rated motor with a 650 W peak, a 48 V 11.6 Ah battery and a claimed range of up to 40 miles, with a top speed of 19 mph in Sport mode, 16 mph in Drive and 11 mph in Eco. It weighs 40 pounds per Hiboy, which is noticeably lighter than the big-battery commuters above. The main limitation is water resistance: Hiboy lists IPX4 and advises against riding in rain, snow or ice, so it suits dry-climate commuters best. Hiboy's own site has shown sale prices around $490 against a much higher regular price, so the S2 Max is often discounted. An alternative listing gives 41.5 pounds and 22 mph; we use Hiboy's figures.",
