          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best electric scooter for most commuters is the Segway Ninebot Max G2: a 551 Wh battery rated at 43 miles, a 22 mph top speed, IPX5 water resistance and listed UL 2272 certification. If you carry your scooter every day, the NIU KQi Air at about 26 pounds is the smarter buy, and the Gotrax G4 covers short trips on a budget.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you choose, size the battery for your real round trip with a margin, check the water rating against your climate, insist on a certified battery and charger, and wear a helmet every ride. Those four decisions matter more than top speed.
